    "created_at": "2016-09-13T20:29:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-13T20:29:23Z",
    "body": "I think that regardless of where the element is moved, having it just work seems better than the extra bookkeeping to prevent it. The fullscreen element ready check is re-run after the resize, so even if the element moved into a document with no `allowfullscreen` attribute, no interesting invariant would be upheld by failing on move.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
