    "created_at": "2016-09-30T08:34:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-30T08:34:58Z",
    "body": "I'd be OK with requiring that the document is the same if that makes things easier for Gecko. Care to draft a PR? I think it'd be simplest to just check the document in the animation frame task, which means the element would be allowed to move to another document and back.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
